WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A hidden hand and an artificial hand.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Two brushes touch in time.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some participants report a change in felt ownership.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Researchers study vision, touch, and body position.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Other researchers ask what participants expected.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A reported experience is not proof of its cause.
